{"id":"9548f0941b8c15ce","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction.md","title":"Finite Numeral Calculations in Q0","display":"lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction — Finite Numeral Calculations in Q0","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction","aliases":["92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction"],"display":"lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction — Finite Numeral Calculations in Q0","source":"第 V 章 pp. 70–71，Proposition 4（PDF 87–88）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction — Finite Numeral Calculations in Q0"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 70–71，Proposition 4（PDF 87–88）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ee662ea7161b3d7\" href=\"?note=8ee662ea7161b3d7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems\">92-df-smullyan-weak-systems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{0,A}\">\\(Q_{0,A}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ee662ea7161b3d7\" href=\"?note=8ee662ea7161b3d7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems\">92-df-smullyan-weak-systems</a> 的八公理系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E\">\\(\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=v_i^E\">\\(v=v_i^E\\)</span> 为原书变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{j=0}^{n}\">\\(\\bigvee_{j=0}^{n}\\)</span> 表示有限对象语言析取。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_{0,A}&amp;\\vdash(\\nu_m+\\nu_n)=\\nu_{m+n},\\\\\nQ_{0,A}&amp;\\vdash(\\nu_m\\cdot\\nu_n)=\\nu_{mn},\\\\\nm\\ne n&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ Q_{0,A}\\vdash\\neg_E(\\nu_m=\\nu_n),\\\\\nQ_{0,A}&amp;\\vdash(v\\leq\\nu_n)\\leftrightarrow_E\\bigvee_{j=0}^{n}(v=\\nu_j).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_{0,A}&amp;\\vdash(\\nu_m+\\nu_n)=\\nu_{m+n},\\\\\nQ_{0,A}&amp;\\vdash(\\nu_m\\cdot\\nu_n)=\\nu_{mn},\\\\\nm\\ne n&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ Q_{0,A}\\vdash\\neg_E(\\nu_m=\\nu_n),\\\\\nQ_{0,A}&amp;\\vdash(v\\leq\\nu_n)\\leftrightarrow_E\\bigvee_{j=0}^{n}(v=\\nu_j).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明对外部自然数 n 作元语言归纳，所得是每一个固定 n 的有限证明，不在 Q₀ 内调用归纳模式。加法从 N3 起步，用 N4 逐次增加第二数码；乘法从 N5 起步，用 N6 和已建立的加法等式逐次计算。不同数码的不等由 N2 的零与后继不等起步，用 N1 消去共同后继。序初始段从 N7 起步，用 N8 和有限命题演算增添一项。变元改名是等式一阶逻辑中的派生操作，可把 v₁ 换成任意 v。</p>\n<p>原书特别强调这里允许元语言数学归纳，即使对象系统没有 N12；不能将该结论误读成 Q₀ 证明一个含自由数变量的全称归纳原则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems","status":"resolved","id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems","status":"resolved","id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q_{0,A}$ 是 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]] 的八公理系统，$\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q_{0,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"v=v_i^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{j=0}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_{0,A}&\\vdash(\\nu_m+\\nu_n)=\\nu_{m+n},\\\\\nQ_{0,A}&\\vdash(\\nu_m\\cdot\\nu_n)=\\nu_{mn},\\\\\nm\\ne n&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ Q_{0,A}\\vdash\\neg_E(\\nu_m=\\nu_n),\\\\\nQ_{0,A}&\\vdash(v\\leq\\nu_n)\\leftrightarrow_E\\bigvee_{j=0}^{n}(v=\\nu_j).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1727,"backlinks":[{"id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书的九公理 Q 及八公理 Q₀ 已独立写为 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]；在原书中 R₀→Q₀ 的 subsystem 关系是定理包含，由 [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] 的逐数码有限证明支撑，不是无限公理集的字面包含。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书弱系统：[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness]]。[[92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence]]完成练习8，说明比较模式 Ω₅ 的实际用途。"},{"id":"1af0375ea8173df2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]]"}],"outgoing":["8ee662ea7161b3d7","51c43e0240787ebb"]}